# Smoke test for weather. With WiFi.status() reporting WL_CONNECTED
# and HTTP fixtures under test/fixtures/http/dataservice.accuweather.com/
# (locations search + currentconditions + 5-day forecast for Beijing,
# location key 101924), the first process tick fires WIFI_CONN, the
# message handler runs the location-key + current-weather + forecast
# fetch chain, and the follow-up `action UP` rerenders display_weather
# with the parsed values (temperature 23°C, humidity 45%, etc).

app weather

wait_ms 800
action UP
wait_ms 600
screenshot 01_with_data
assert_no_crash

action RETURN
wait_ms 200
assert_no_crash
